            "line": 255,
            "text": "theorem exists_unique_quadratic_correction [CompleteSpace E]\n    (B : E ≃L[ℝ] E) (A : E →L[ℝ] E →L[ℝ] E) (d : E) (r : ℝ) (hr : 0 ≤ r)\n    (hsmall : 4 * ‖B.symm.toContinuousLinearMap‖ * ‖A‖ * r ≤ 1)\n    (hd : 2 * ‖B.symm.toContinuousLinearMap‖ * ‖d‖ ≤ r) :\n    ∃! c : E, ‖c‖ ≤ r ∧ B c + A c c = d"
